echnology segment.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2020 Q1","e":"ndsn","d":"2020-02-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Greg Thaxton","x":"…income for the quarter was $52 million and GAAP diluted earnings per share were $0.89, inclusive of a $0.04 per share charge related to restructuring and a $0.04 per share discrete tax benefit related to stock-based compensation.We delivered first quarter EBITDA of $101 million or 20% of sales.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2020 Q1","e":"ndsn","d":"2020-02-20","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Sundaram Nagarajan","x":"And you're right, we are at that point in terms of typical order rates will pick up to have us confidence in delivering that second -- strong second half, and that's what gives us the strength in maintaining our guidance for the full year of 1% to 3%.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2020 Q2","e":"ndsn","d":"2020-05-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sundaram Nagarajan","x":"…around making sure our customers are really having good productivity and certainly working on cost savings.So as you can think about it, right, in terms of your – recap of our capital positions, our businesses and our systems are such, their value is very small when compared to the savings…","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2020 Q2","e":"ndsn","d":"2020-05-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Walter Liptak","x":"Did you do any furloughs or layoffs, any kind of pay related cuts or cutting back on bonus accruals, because of the virus?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2020 Q3","e":"ndsn","d":"2020-08-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sundaram Nagarajan","x":"We typically look at annual price increases.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2020 Q3","e":"ndsn","d":"2020-08-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Walter Liptak","x":"You know, when do you typically do, you know, annual price increases and are there any businesses where you can get price even, you know, with this slowness going on in the economy?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2020 Q3","e":"ndsn","d":"2020-08-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joe Kelley","x":"…profit in the quarter was $112 million or 21% of sales, excluding nonrecurring items in the quarter related to cost reduction actions and the acquired inventory step-up amortization, adjusted operating profit totaled $120 million, a 9% decrease from the prior-year adjusted operating profit.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2020 Q3","e":"ndsn","d":"2020-08-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joe Kelley","x":"Cost reduction actions taken in the quarter to structurally lower the ongoing cost profile of the company totaled $6 million and primarily related to severance payments.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2020 Q4","e":"ndsn","d":"2020-12-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joe Kelley","x":"So there are areas where we continue to invest, and there are areas where we are taking strategic I would say structural cost reduction actions.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2020 Q4","e":"ndsn","d":"2020-12-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joe Kelley","x":"…margins sequentially and our stay on year-over-year basis because that is where you are seeing the benefits of some of those structural cost reduction actions in the Q1 numbers, but I will go back to Q4 and I'd just point out, I mean quite please with IPS, 30% OP as a percent of sales.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2021 Q1","e":"ndsn","d":"2021-02-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph P. Kelley","x":"This 190 basis point increase in gross margin was driven by the combination of volume leverage, improved sales mix and benefits from structural cost reduction measures taken in fiscal 2020.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2021 Q1","e":"ndsn","d":"2021-02-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph P. Kelley","x":"It is here in the operating profit growth rate that you see additional benefits from the fiscal 2020 cost reduction efforts as SG&A decreased 4% from the prior year first quarter level of $188 million.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2021 Q2","e":"ndsn","d":"2021-05-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph Kelley","x":"This 260 basis point increase in gross margin was driven by the combination of improved sales mix, volume leverage and benefits from structural cost reduction measures taken in fiscal 2020.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2021 Q3","e":"ndsn","d":"2021-08-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Allison Poliniak","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2021 Q3","e":"ndsn","d":"2021-08-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph P. Kelley","x":"This 430 basis point increase in gross margin was driven by volume leverage, benefits from structural cost reduction measures taken in fiscal 2020, and improved sales mix particularly resulting from the divested Screw and Barrel product line at the beginning of fiscal second quarter.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2021 Q3","e":"ndsn","d":"2021-08-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sundaram Nagarajan","x":"You see our team standardizing product offering, reducing complexity, streamlining and dedicating products to the most important products in the business, prioritizing our best growth opportunities, our best customers.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2021 Q4","e":"ndsn","d":"2021-12-16","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sundaram Nagarajan","x":"And so what that means is that we have a differentiated position and are able to pass along price increases where that is necessary.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2021 Q4","e":"ndsn","d":"2021-12-16","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sundaram Nagarajan","x":"Our expectations for pricing is going to be higher than our normal price increases that we have got.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2021 Q4","e":"ndsn","d":"2021-12-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph Kelley","x":"Double-digit organic growth, favorable sales mix and continued benefits from structural cost reduction actions taken in fiscal 2020, all contributed to incremental operating profit margins of 52% in the quarter.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2022 Q2","e":"ndsn","d":"2022-05-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joseph Kelley","x":"The team continues to actively manage the price-cost dynamic in these inflationary periods and benefited from improved price realization compared sequentially to the first quarter of fiscal 2022.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2022 Q2","e":"ndsn","d":"2022-05-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joseph Kelley","x":"Yes Allison, when you look at our performance going Q1 to Q2, actually our price realization was a little bit better than what we had anticipated going into Q2.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2022 Q2","e":"ndsn","d":"2022-05-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sundaram Nagarajan","x":"…work we’ve done, but it is still a cycle, so we’re in a good part of the cycle, we have taken cost out, we’ve materially improved the position of the business well, we have mix help in there, so there are a number of contributing factors, so my caution would be let’s give it a couple of…","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2022 Q3","e":"ndsn","d":"2022-08-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Pez","x":"I’ll pass it on.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2022 Q3","e":"ndsn","d":"2022-08-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joseph Kelley","x":"…Naga, I’ll take the price versus cost - again, it was favorable in terms of we were successful in passing through the cost increase in terms of pricing, but it was negative impact from a margin standpoint because it’s not like remaining cost increase plus 56% on top of it, it was simply…","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2022 Q3","e":"ndsn","d":"2022-08-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph Kelley","x":"Excluding one-time restructuring costs, adjusted gross profit totaled $368 million or 56% of sales.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2022 Q3","e":"ndsn","d":"2022-08-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph Kelley","x":"During the quarter, we recorded one-time restructuring costs associated with a facility consolidation in the EFB division of the ATS segment and the closure of our Russian operations.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2022 Q3","e":"ndsn","d":"2022-08-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Joseph Kelley","x":"Yes, so when you think about our Q4 2022 guidance, first of all, I would tell you maintaining the guidance range suggests an increase in the organic growth forecast, given the fact that FX was a greater headwind than it was when we initially gave the guidance, and so when you think about Q4, our…","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2022 Q3","e":"ndsn","d":"2022-08-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Joseph Kelley","x":"Those are some of the thoughts that went into our guidance, maintaining our guidance, which is really increasing our organic growth forecast.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2022 Q4","e":"ndsn","d":"2022-12-15","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joe Kelley","x":"The 18% organic sales increase was driven by solid 14% volume growth and approximately 4% in pricing as we passed through cost inflation.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2022 Q4","e":"ndsn","d":"2022-12-15","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joe Kelley","x":"Most significant was the passing through of cost inflation which, while relatively neutral from a gross profit dollar perspective, diluted the margins approximately 140 basis points.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2023 Q1","e":"ndsn","d":"2023-02-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joe Kelley","x":"But we have been successful in passing through the inflation but not passing through the inflation plus the 55% gross margin.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2023 Q1","e":"ndsn","d":"2023-02-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joe Kelley","x":"And so passing that through this division clearly has, I would say, led the way and been successful in that pricing initiative.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2023 Q2","e":"ndsn","d":"2023-05-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joe Kelley","x":"I would tell you that the price realization for Nordson broadly improved in Q2, and so I would estimate that approximately 4% of that 9% for IPS segment would be attributed to price and 4% would be volume.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2023 Q2","e":"ndsn","d":"2023-05-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joe Kelley","x":"And so here, that is price cost balanced for Nordson is no longer pressuring the gross margins as we have realized the price increase to offset inflation and maintain our margins.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2023 Q2","e":"ndsn","d":"2023-05-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joe Kelley","x":"Excluding severance costs, gross profit totaled $354 million, or 55% of sales, comparable to first quarter 2023 profitability as the team continues to actively manage the price cost dynamic and these inflationary periods.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2023 Q2","e":"ndsn","d":"2023-05-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joe Kelley","x":"During the quarter, we recorded one-time severance costs totaling $3 million.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2023 Q3","e":"ndsn","d":"2023-08-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Sundaram Nagarajan","x":"We expect to benefit from customer investments in automation, memory, AI and electronics new product innovation.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2023 Q3","e":"ndsn","d":"2023-08-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"unknown","s":"Unidentified Participant","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2023 Q3","e":"ndsn","d":"2023-08-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph Kelley","x":"Excluding severance cost, gross profit totaled $362 million or 56% of sales, which is comparable to the prior year third quarter.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2023 Q3","e":"ndsn","d":"2023-08-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph Kelley","x":"Adjusted earnings per share excluding non-recurring acquisition and severance cost totaled $2.35 per share, a 6% decrease from the prior year adjusted earnings.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2023 Q4","e":"ndsn","d":"2023-12-14","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joseph Kelley","x":"The organic sales decrease was primarily volume offset by price as we continue to pass through year-over-year cost inflation.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2023 Q4","e":"ndsn","d":"2023-12-14","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Stephen Shamrock","x":"So we've not passed through large inflationary price increases as a result of that.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2023 Q4","e":"ndsn","d":"2023-12-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Andrew Buscaglia","x":"But is the main driver here for ATS long-term volumes just picking back up, or are there cost-saving potential in that segment to get those up closer to a corporate average margin?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2024 Q1","e":"ndsn","d":"2024-02-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Stephen Shamrock","x":"Consistent with prior quarters, the organic sales decrease was primarily volume, partially offset by price as we continue to pass through year-over-year cost inflation.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2024 Q1","e":"ndsn","d":"2024-02-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stephen Shamrock","x":"While the reduction in EBITDA was tied to the overall decrease in volume, favorable mix and cost reduction actions contributed to 32% decremental margins on adjusted operating profits.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2024 Q1","e":"ndsn","d":"2024-02-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Andrew Buscaglia","x":"And I'm wondering how much more is left in the tank as it pertains to pricing and things like cost savings? ﻿ Sundaram Nagarajan: Think of Ascend and NBS Next as a growth framework, rather than a cost play.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2024 Q2","e":"ndsn","d":"2024-05-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stephen Shamrock","x":"Adjusted earnings per share, excluding $2 million of nonrecurring cost reduction actions and amortization of acquisition-related intangibles of $19 million totaled $2.34 per share, a 4% decrease from the prior year adjusted earnings per share amount of $2.45.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2024 Q2","e":"ndsn","d":"2024-05-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stephen Shamrock","x":"Second quarter EBITDA was $63 million or 37% of sales, which was flat to the prior year EBITDA of $63 million, which excluded $1.5 million of special items for cost reduction actions.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2024 Q3","e":"ndsn","d":"2024-08-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael Pesendorfer","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2024 Q3","e":"ndsn","d":"2024-08-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daniel Hopgood","x":"Net income in the quarter totaled $117 million or $2.04 per share, excluding $8 million of non-recurring costs related to the Atrion acquisition and selected restructuring charges, as well as $19 million in amortization of acquisition-related intangibles.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2024 Q3","e":"ndsn","d":"2024-08-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daniel Hopgood","x":"Third quarter EBITDA was $26 million or 21% of sales, below prior year third quarter EBITDA of $33 million, which excluded special items of $2 million related to cost reduction actions in the prior year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2024 Q4","e":"ndsn","d":"2024-12-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Daniel Hopgood","x":"And then are we talking about sort of the tariff issue and that's causing the uncertainty in the headwind?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2024 Q4","e":"ndsn","d":"2024-12-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daniel Hopgood","x":"Adjusted operating profit, which excludes $26 million in non-recurring costs related to the Atrion acquisition and one-time restructuring costs during the quarter, was $205 million, up 30 basis points from the prior year on a percentage of sales basis.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2024 Q4","e":"ndsn","d":"2024-12-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daniel Hopgood","x":"GAAP net income totaled $122 million or $2.12 per diluted share, while adjusted earnings per share excluding nonrecurring acquisition and restructuring-related expenses totaled $2.78 per share, a 3% increase over the prior year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2025 Q1","e":"ndsn","d":"2025-02-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daniel Hopgood","x":"Excluding $10 million of nonrecurring costs related to the Atrion acquisition and selected restructuring actions as well as $19 million in amortization of acquisition-related intangibles, adjusted earnings per share totaled $2.06 per share, slightly above the midpoint of our quarterly guidance,…","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"NDSN 2025 Q1","e":"ndsn","d":"2025-02-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Andrew 