nscripts/2026/02/19/nordson-ndsn-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NDSN 2026 Q2","e":"ndsn","d":"2026-05-21","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Sundaram Nagarajan","x":"But on top of this, what you have is our close to the customer business model, allowing us to innovate on technologies that are needed for our customers as the new AI applications occur, as AI infrastructure happens and semiconductors become more complex, more difficult to manufacture.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/21/nordson-ndsn-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"NDSN 2026 Q2","e":"ndsn","d":"2026-05-21","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Sundaram Nagarajan","x":"There is more technology and innovation that is happening in this business that will allow our customers to really get after the AI compute needs that they have.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/21/nordson-ndsn-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"NDSN 2026 Q2","e":"ndsn","d":"2026-05-21","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Daniel Hopgood","x":"And when I say that, I would include tariffs in that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/21/nordson-ndsn-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"NDSN 2026 Q2","e":"ndsn","d":"2026-05-21","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Daniel Hopgood","x":"We don't talk -- tariffs in itself are not material, but I would say it's part of the broader inflationary impact we're seeing as we look at the price of components and resins and other inputs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/21/nordson-ndsn-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"NDSN 2026 Q2","e":"ndsn","d":"2026-05-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Robert Jamieson","x":"When I think about the precise nature of your dispensing offer in IPS and inflationary input environment, your offering really positioned Luke as a cost savings partner in a way.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/21/nordson-ndsn-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"NDSN 2026 Q2","e":"ndsn","d":"2026-05-21","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Sundaram Nagarajan","x":"Based on the momentum in our end markets, as evidenced by our backlog and order entry, we are increasing our full year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/21/nordson-ndsn-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"NDSN 2026 Q2","e":"ndsn","d":"2026-05-21","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Sundaram Nagarajan","x":"And so the momentum across the company is strong, and that's why you see us increasing guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/21/nordson-ndsn-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[40,1,3585,0,0,0,2414,903],[41,1,8188,0,0,0,6175,1540],[42,1,7690,0,0,0,6158,1255],[43,1,6792,0,0,0,5216,1152],[44,1,5195,0,0,0,3698,1132],[45,1,2764,0,0,0,2524,0],[46,1,8218,0,0,0,5958,1844],[47,1,8039,0,0,0,6354,1326],[49,1,6260,0,0,0,4811,1103],[50,1,7833,0,0,0,6116,1285],[51,1,6974,0,0,0,5320,1239],[52,1,7105,0,0,0,5846,913],[53,1,7368,0,0,0,5616,1335],[54,1,7051,0,0,0,5473,1039],[55,1,7621,0,0,0,5795,1399],[56,1,6149,0,0,0,3127,2673],[57,1,7354,0,0,0,5506,1421],[58,1,7165,0,0,0,5886,914],[59,1,9114,0,0,0,7325,1300],[60,1,7892,0,0,0,6015,1445],[62,1,6785,0,0,0,4680,1594],[64,1,8594,0,0,0,6426,1381],[65,1,6988,0,0,0,5762,912]],"cinema":[[40,1,3585,0,0,0,2414,903],[41,1,8188,0,0,0,6175,1540],[42,1,7690,0,0,0,6158,1255],[43,1,6792,0,0,0,5216,1152],[44,1,5195,0,0,0,3698,1132],[45,1,2764,0,0,0,2524,0],[46,1,8218,0,0,0,5958,1844],[47,1,8039,0,0,0,6354,1326],[49,1,6260,0,0,0,4811,1103],[50,1,7833,0,0,0,6116,1285],[51,1,6974,0,0,0,5320,1239],[52,1,7105,0,0,0,5846,913],[53,1,7368,0,0,0,5616,1335],[54,1,7051,0,0,0,5473,1039],[55,1,7621,0,0,0,5795,1399],[56,1,6149,0,0,0,3127,2673],[57,1,7354,0,0,0,5506,1421],[58,1,7165,0,0,0,5886,914],[59,1,9114,0,0,0,7325,1300],[60,1,7892,0,0,0,6015,1445],[62,1,6785,0,0,0,4680,1594],[64,1,8594,0,0,0,6426,1381],[65,1,6988,0,0,0,5762,91